      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋuɔ̱t kɛ kui̱ mucni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Kuoth Nhial Muthɛ la̱r lär ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jiök ni Ä-ron kɛnɛ gaatkɛ i̱, “Tiɛtdɛ gɔy mucni ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, tin ca lëy ɣä, kɛ ɣöö /cikɛ ciötdä min rɛl gɔɔydɛ rɔ bi ya̱r. Ɛ ɣän Kuoth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jiök nikɛ i̱, ‘Mi wec tekɛ raan kä kuayku diaal rɛy ri̱cnikiɛn mi wä ben gekä mucni tin rɛl gɔɔydiɛn rɔ, tin lëy kɛ Kuoth Nhial ɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, kä /cɛ gɔaa, ɛn ram ɛmɔ /cɛ la̱tdä bi nyɔk kɛ lätni. Ɛ ɣän Kuoth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A thil raan kä gaat Ä-ron mi tekɛ dhɔp kiɛ löny pua̱ny mi jiäk, mi bi tin lɛy gɔɔydiɛn rɔ cam a ni mi cɛ gɔaa. Kä bööth palä mɔ bi duɔ̱ɔ̱r mi jiäk mi ci li̱w thiap ɔ kiɛ wut mi tekɛ ti̱i̱y, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kiɛ ram mi ci muɔl piny nyɔt mi dëë jɛ jak kä jiäk kiɛ jëk ɛ jɛ kä raan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ɛn ram ɔ ci duɔ̱ɔ̱r nyɔt ɔ bɛ jiäk mäni thiaŋ kä /cɛ bi mi̱th kä tin rɛl gɔɔydiɛn rɔ a ni mi cɛ puak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi wä cäŋ kony bɛ gɔaa. Ɛn wa̱nɔ derɛ cu mi̱th kä tin rɛl gɔɔydiɛn rɔ, kɛ ɣöö kɛ mi̱thkɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn mɔ bi li̱w kä rɔa kiɛ ca näk ɛ le̱y dɔaar ɔ /ci bo̱o̱th palä jɛ bi cam, derɛ puɔ̱nydɛ ya̱r kɛ jɛ. Ɛ ɣän Kuoth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ bööth palä ŋuɔ̱tkä tit, mi cikɛn kɛ bi tit bikɛ duer kä bikɛ li̱w, ɛ ɣän Kuoth Nhial min jakɛ kä gɔw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘A thil ram mi bä raar gölä kä ji̱ dhɔaar bööth palä mi bi mi̱th kä muc in rɛl gɔɔydɛ rɔ. A cäŋɛ ja̱l gɔaal bööth palä kiɛ ja̱ŋdɛ /cɛ jɛ bi cam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö mi ci bööth palä ja̱ŋ kɔk kɛ yio̱w, ɛn ja̱ŋ ɛmɔ bɛ mi̱th thi̱n. Kä kɛn tin diaal tin ca dap dhɔrɛ bikɛ mi̱ethdɛ cam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nya bööth palä mi ca kuɛn raar /cɛ bi mi̱th kä muc tin rɛl gɔɔydiɛn rɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ ni mi nya bööth palä ɛ ciek jɔkä kiɛ ɛ kɛ̈ɛ̈, kä thil ɛ jɛ gat, kä cɛ luny dhɔr gua̱n, ce̱tkɛ mëë tëë nyi̱etdä, derɛ mi̱eth gua̱n cam. Kä ŋotdɛ thilɛ ram mi bä raar mi bi jɛ cam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi ci raan mi̱eth in rɛl gɔɔydɛ rɔ cam a cɛ lot ni jɛ, bɛ jɛ rëp nikɛ dhieec dhieecni kä bɛ jɛ ka̱m bööth palä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn bööth palä cɛ nyin I-thɛ-rɛl tin rɛl gɔɔydiɛn rɔ bi ya̱r, tin ca thöp Kuoth Nhial, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä a /cikɛ bi jak kä dui̱rkɛ, kɛ mi̱ethdiɛn kɛ tin rɛl gɔɔydiɛn rɔ, inɔ bɛ duer nööŋ mi bikɛ moc riɛk. Ɛ ɣän Kuoth Nhial min jak yɛ kä gɔw.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Kuoth Nhial Muthɛ jiök, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ruacni kɛ Ä-ron kɛnɛ gaatkɛ kɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal i̱, “Mi wä raan dhɔaar I-thɛ-rɛl kiɛ ram mi cieŋ rɛydiɛn mucdɛ nööŋ, ɛ muc cutdä yäcä kiɛ ɛ muc lɔacdɛ mi thöpɛ Kuoth ala muc mi waŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ ɣöö ba nhɔk ala tuut mi thil diw, ruath tha̱a̱k rɔɔmä kiɛ böw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Cu duɔ̱ɔ̱r mi tekɛ diw thöp, kɛ ɣöö /ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ bi nhɔk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi wä raan muc malädɛ wä thöp Kuoth Nhial, mi yacɛ ni rɔ kiɛ muc lɔacdɛ, bɛ jɛ ka̱n rɛy ɣɔ̱ɔ̱kɛ kiɛ rɛy deetkɛ, kɛ ɣöö bi Kuoth Nhial ɛ nhɔk ba mi kök kök, mi thil diw puɔ̱nydɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Cuarɛ muc mi waŋkɛ thöp Kuoth Nhial wi̱i̱ yi̱kä kä le̱y ɛ ti. Ley mi cɔr, ŋɔl, kiɛ mi löny puɔ̱nydɛ, kiɛ te kuat, kiɛ cäk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä thäk kɛnɛ ruath ro̱mä tin tɔ̱ cäkni bia kɛ nöŋ ala muc tɛthkä lɔacdun, kä mi wec wa̱a̱ muc yäcä ca jɛ bi nhɔk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi te le̱y mi ca nhiandɛ kuit kiɛ ca doŋ, /cia jɛ bi thöp Kuoth Nhial kä cɛ bia luur guäth ciɛŋädun ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/cuarɛ le̱y mi nööŋkɛ ɛ ram mi guä thöp Kuothdun ala luur mi̱eth kä tekɛ kɛ diw kä kɛ cäkni, /ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ bi nhök yɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Kuoth Nhial Muthɛ jiök i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mi wa ruath wä diëth ɛ rɔam kiɛ ɛ böw, bɛ man luɛth kɛ ni̱n bärɔw, kɛ cäŋ in bädäkdiɛn, dëë jɛ nhɔk ala muc mi wa̱ŋkɛ Kuoth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu yaŋ thöp ala muc kɛnɛ dɔwdɛ kiɛ rɔam kɛnɛ ruathdɛ kɛn cäŋ ɛ kɛlɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
